  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HKSjwdn/Living-Things.jpg\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"> <strong>为Minecraft添加多种新生物，让世界更加生机勃勃</strong> </span></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"分割线\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">生物/物品的详细信息通过<strong>Patchouli</strong>（Vazkii制作）提供&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点此下载</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">（非必需但<strong>强烈推荐</strong>）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组支持Forge、Fabric（1.18.2起）和NeoForge（1.20.4起）。请查看文件页获取所有版本。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Fabric版本需要Fabric-API </span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点此获取</a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"分割线\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">生物/物品的完整文档详见<strong>维基</strong>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击查看</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">游戏内截图请查看图库</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Elephant\" rel=\"nofollow\">大象</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Giraffe\" rel=\"nofollow\">长颈鹿</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Lion\" rel=\"nofollow\">狮子</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shark\" rel=\"nofollow\">鲨鱼</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Penguin\" rel=\"nofollow\">企鹅</a></strong> </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Elephant\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PShrSK2/x170-elephant.png\" alt=\"大象\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Giraffe\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/d4v4Vk38/x170-giraffe-1.png\" alt=\"长颈鹿\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Lion\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VWPR0c5y/x170-lion.png\" alt=\"狮子\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shark\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9kGxr6Mk/x170-shark.png\" alt=\"鲨鱼\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Penguin\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z6SkjYSc/x170-penguin.png\" alt=\"企鹅\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ostrich\" rel=\"nofollow\">鸵鸟</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Flamingo\" rel=\"nofollow\">火烈鸟</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Crab\" rel=\"nofollow\">螃蟹</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Mantaray\" rel=\"nofollow\">蝠鲼</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Raccoon\" rel=\"nofollow\">浣熊</a></strong> </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ostrich\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z12Wtz4W/x170-ostrich.png\" alt=\"鸵鸟\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Flamingo\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/n8nRjdgs/x170-flamingo.png\" alt=\"火烈鸟\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Crab\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zhPLtBkR/x170-crab-red.png\" alt=\"螃蟹\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Mantaray\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4n7jGDDL/x170-mantaray-blue.png\" alt=\"蝠鲼\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Raccoon\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/YBndBzHc/x170-raccoon.png\" alt=\"浣熊\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Owl\" rel=\"nofollow\">猫头鹰</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ancient-Blaze\" rel=\"nofollow\">远古烈焰人</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Koala\" rel=\"nofollow\">考拉</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Snail\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜗牛</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Monkey\" rel=\"nofollow\">猴子</a></strong> </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Owl\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ymP9Qjbv/x170-owl-brown.png\" alt=\"猫头鹰\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ancient-Blaze\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/CpW4Kx6c/x170-ancient-blaze.png\" alt=\"远古烈焰人\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Koala\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9k24KZsm/x170-koala.png\" alt=\"考拉\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Snail\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dJ1vdgjq/x170-snail-blue.png\" alt=\"蜗牛\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Monkey\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/99FHb035/x170-monkey.png\" alt=\"猴子\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Nether-Knight\" rel=\"nofollow\">下界骑士</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shroomie\" rel=\"nofollow\">蘑菇精灵</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Seahorse\" rel=\"nofollow\">海马</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Baby-Enderdragon\" rel=\"nofollow\">末影龙宝宝</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Peacock\" rel=\"nofollow\">孔雀</a></strong> </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Nether-Knight\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/q3F0xV3H/x170-nether-knight.png\" alt=\"下界骑士\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shroomie\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rK4xbM0p/x170-shroomie-red.png\" alt=\"蘑菇精灵\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Seahorse\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/27R8skfB/x170-seahorse-blue.png\" alt=\"海马\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Baby-Enderdragon\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TD4RGbsB/x170-baby-ender-dragon.png\" alt=\"末影龙宝宝\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Peacock\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tGS4jmy/x170-peacock.png\" alt=\"孔雀\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"分割线\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> 如有任何问题或想了解未来更新计划： </span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> 欢迎加入我的&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"> </a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> </span></p>",
